        "abstract": "This paper looks at innovation in its broadest sense from a small firm's perspective, where the author focuses on culture and people-a key catalyst for innovation in any organisation. He then discloses the main findings from a project, which identified the important attributes that enabled organisations that had achieved Millennium Product status to capture new markets and capitalise on significant business opportunities.",
